   "now": "Vial 1989 main cloth: warp 38.3, weft 25.4 per cm; side strip 38.1 and 26.2. 38.6 x 25.7 is Raes 1973-74; 38.1 x 25.8 mixes the side strip's warp with the overall weft. The 2026 paper's own count is 37-41 x 26-29.",
